*.local

# Rust
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# Staging copy, rebuilt from seed/ by scripts/prepare-resources.mjs.
src-tauri/resources/

# Songbooks and Bible translations belong to the device, not the repository.
# They are a congregation's own library — often licensed text that must not be
# redistributed — and they are tens of megabytes of binary that would sit in
# every clone for ever. A build with no seed simply starts empty, and the app
# imports songbooks and translations from the Settings and Songs tabs.
#
# `seed-default/` is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the small library every
# install starts with, so it has to travel with the repository to reach a
# release build. Only redistributable text goes in there.
seed/

# Cached download used by scripts/build-english-bible.mjs
scripts/.cache-*.json

# Generated by scripts/make-icon.mjs; src-tauri/icons/ is derived from it.
app-icon.png

# Secrets — nothing here today, keep it that way.
# The updater's signing key. It lives in ~/.lyricverse and as a repo secret;
# a copy landing in here would let anyone sign an update for this app.
updater.key
updater.key.pub
*.key.pem
